source synthesized, not recorded: a slow two-finger scroll on a macOS trackpad (NSEvent phase Began, Changed every 8-12 ms with a few points each), a rest of 200 ms with the fingers down (no events: AppKit sends none while they do not move), more scrolling the other way, and a lift with no momentum (phase Ended, no momentumPhase follows when the fingers had stopped); then fingers resting and lifting without scrolling (phase MayBegin, then Cancelled, which winit 0.30 maps to started and ended). Phase mapping as in winit's macos/view.rs scroll_wheel.
